{
  "character": "ChuChu Rocket",
  "_notes": {
    "utilt_dtilt": "This character's source data (SuminI MUGEN template) only authors a single standing side attack (ftilt) plus charged up/down smashes - there is no distinct plain up-tilt/down-tilt animation, so those two slots are intentionally left unfilled rather than duplicating the smash art.",
    "specialAir": "No distinct airborne special animations exist in the source data; lite-fighter.html already falls back to the grounded specialN/S/U/D move when a character has no *Air variant assigned, so the same 4 specials work in the air automatically.",
    "throws": "This character has no grab/throw states at all in its source .cns (mouse-themed moveset skips the grab game entirely) - engine also has no grab/throw mechanic regardless."
  },
